WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,970 --> 00:00:03,210
Finished the morning's work

2
00:00:03,450 --> 00:00:04,930
Follow my arrangements in the afternoon

3
00:00:06,710 --> 00:00:07,790
Then how do you calculate your account?

4
00:00:08,990 --> 00:00:10,070
I'll pay you back twice as much tomorrow

5
00:00:10,230 --> 00:00:11,950
But you are mine this afternoon

6
00:00:12,510 --> 00:00:15,540
How is it? Does it look good?

7
00:00:16,060 --> 00:00:17,300
Brought from the ship

8
00:00:17,740 --> 00:00:19,780
It would have been easier for you to keep the ones you wore for the swimming pool.

9
00:00:25,380 --> 00:00:27,060
I'll prepare it for you for free.

10
00:00:27,540 --> 00:00:30,920
It doesn’t matter whether you are preparing by rubbing or weighing.

11
00:00:31,320 --> 00:00:33,120
Anyway, I’ve booked the venue this afternoon.

12
00:00:36,830 --> 00:00:40,150
Lin Feng, I haven’t been given the list for tomorrow yet. I’ll get back to you soon.

13
00:00:40,770 --> 00:00:42,210
When can I not ask for a list?

14
00:00:42,210 --> 00:01:03,920
I have to rush for half a day, so I have to prepare myself. There is a stone over there that is suitable for cold feet, Sister Lin Tuo.

15
00:01:03,920 --> 00:01:07,060
You went into the water to catch fish, but you caught nothing.

16
00:01:08,370 --> 00:01:09,930
Does it count if the burnt stone is upturned?

17
00:01:11,780 --> 00:01:13,060
I tried my hair and it came back

18
00:01:13,340 --> 00:01:14,700
Is this half a day worth it?

19
00:01:15,380 --> 00:01:16,590
Stop gloating about your misfortune

20
00:01:17,820 --> 00:01:20,380
How do you know that the palace will be closed tomorrow?

21
00:01:21,160 --> 00:01:22,120
If Sister Zhao Ya burns

22
00:01:23,380 --> 00:01:24,420
I heard that I want to go into the mountains

23
00:01:24,420 --> 00:01:28,020
If you fight hard, don't fight back.

24
00:01:28,020 --> 00:01:29,300
Someone has to catch it, right?

25
00:01:29,500 --> 00:01:32,320
What is that stuff? Can it be eaten? Wait.

26
00:01:32,320 --> 00:01:33,480
We'll find out tomorrow night
